{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your empty patio into a bustling catio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you place higher quality decorations, your catio will attract cats with more discerning tastes. Cats with better taste require more pets but also earn you larger adoption fees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/c7d50478c8434ac47d49390d8c915d71.poster.avif?t=1760017776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/c7d50478c8434ac47d49390d8c915d71.webm?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/c7d50478c8434ac47d49390d8c915d71.mp4?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Cats Get Adopted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet your cats to prepare them for adoption. Once they're ready, adopt them out and collect their adoption fees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/3743c693d00b4cccc177d6070c34f34e.poster.avif?t=1760017776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/3743c693d00b4cccc177d6070c34f34e.webm?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/3743c693d00b4cccc177d6070c34f34e.mp4?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Petting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate and improve your petting with a variety of upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/4819c5d01f5a554698b285291d9054ec.poster.avif?t=1760017776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/4819c5d01f5a554698b285291d9054ec.webm?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/4819c5d01f5a554698b285291d9054ec.mp4?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Track Your Visitors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up your cat-a-log with all your catio's visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/0bf91d916bb2ac2f2e8b2b27b95dab9e.poster.avif?t=1760017776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/0bf91d916bb2ac2f2e8b2b27b95dab9e.webm?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/0bf91d916bb2ac2f2e8b2b27b95dab9e.mp4?t=1760017776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814540?t=1760017776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814540?t=1760017776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/d2c9e7da7d126bbe43224e8dfeff3f12dfd88f09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760017776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/d2c9e7da7d126bbe43224e8dfeff3f12dfd88f09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760017776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id"